**Decision in one line:** the allow-list becomes ballot B8, held until both voters can receive it in the same minute. The executor continues only on steps that do not depend on it. The acceptance goes to the operator as an instruction, not a question.

Paths under `orchestrator/` are my scratch space; `<…>` values are filled from the commands in step 1.

